<title>UK: Vodafone has one million digital subscribers.</title>
<headline>Vodafone has one million digital subscribers.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vodafone Group Plc on Monday said it signed up the millionth customer to use its digital mobile 'phone network.</p>
<p>At the end of September, Vodafone had a total of 2,655,000 subscribers, which included more than 1.6 million analogue customers.</p>
<p>Vodafone, which claimed it was the first digital network operator with one million subscribers, said its lead over rivals in the digital mobile 'phone market continued to grow.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
